WEBVTT

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.880
<b>Chukyo High School 52nd Track Meet</b>

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.710
Kaede!

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.330
You've got this in the bag!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.790
Gotta jump... jump high!

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.130
Haruko and everyone else are counting on me.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:39.000
Can you really do it?

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.130
You want Haruko to see how cool you are, right?

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.460
She'll probably hate you if you screw this up.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.670
Want me to lend you a hand?

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.420
Kaede...?

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.540
What's she doing?

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.460
She did it!

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.460
Where'd she go?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.500
"I just don't care anymore"

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.290
A reply thrown out

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:02.080
Briefly blooming then briefly falling, over and over

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.630
Left feeling unsatisfied

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:08.540
Yes, day by day, I walked on

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.830
Cry, futurity, gloomy

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:14.830
The twilight still out of reach

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.210
Don't lose your way

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:20.380
Tighten the twine of dreams

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.790
Take me so high

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.630
Start running to a brand new life

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:28.170
Everything I have in my hand

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.830
Holding onto seven colors

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.710
Go ahead, make my day

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.080
I'll use this fist to rebel even harder!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.540
Everything I have in my hand

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.290
Sketching ideals and hopes

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.880
I won't let you down

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.170
I'll let this flower bloom forever!

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:51.830
Believe myself

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:03.790
<b>Flight</b>

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.960
That looks bad.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.960
Somebody call the police!

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.040
Hey Kaede!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:19.500
You're late!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.670
Glad I made it in time!

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:25.830
Did you not hear what I just said?!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.880
Sorry about that!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.630
This is Kaede. We've captured the vessel.

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.830
Things are under control down here, but...

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.080
I'm still sensing the presence of Oni.
Please stay on your guard.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:40.500
Don't have to tell me twice!
The place absolutely reeks of Oni!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:41.880
Where are they?

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.330
Up there!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:49.330
These damn newfangled Oni can fly! Bunch of show-offs!

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.670
A new breed of Oni?!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.630
They must be evolving somehow.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.420
Come get some!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.540
You're in the way!

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.040
Hey, I've got dibs on those!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.290
You can't even reach them!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:02.710
This calls for some...

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.790
WILL POOOOWER!

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:06.080
Wait, Ibara!

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:07.880
What the heck are you doing?!

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.380
Ugh! Quit dragging me down, twerp!

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.790
Rescue is our top priority!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.710
We gotta get that guy out of here!

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.380
Get the vessel to safety!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.420
Roger that!

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.040
Uh oh! They went into my blind spot!

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:28.880
Leave the rest to me!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.460
Great work!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.670
Those are some lame-ass fireworks.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.380
Just one left!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.420
Where is it?!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.130
Kaede!

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.170
Sorry... I let it get away.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.710
I get the feeling that I should pay my mom a visit...

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:16.540
Oni devour the souls of the weak and possess their
bodies, using them as a vessel to manifest in our world.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.000
We managed to save the vessel this time,

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.920
but the Oni that escaped will try
to latch onto a new victim instead.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.330
Then we'll bring it down before that happens!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.460
That's our main mission!

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.040
Isn't that right?

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.040
Enough with the hero act already.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.960
Oh come on, that's exactly what we all are!

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.250
Your enthusiasm is killing me.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:37.880
Huh?

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.960
It's okay, Kaede. Nobody thinks its your fault!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.210
Don't say it!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.670
I don't need a pep talk.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.960
See you guys tomorrow.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:49.460
Wait up!

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:50.750
Huh?

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.500
Wh-what? You're leaving already?!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:54.790
Please just leave us be!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.750
Uh, okay...

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.670
You know, I think I should go after them!

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:03.880
Keep your nose out of it.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:04.960
But I...!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:09.670
Listen, up until you came long,
it was really only girls here.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.330
What's with that look?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:17.500
It's hard to explain, but those two have
a bit of a complicated relationship.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.420
Quit giving me that look already!

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.960
Putting all that aside, there's a good reason
I need to bring those two back here.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.920
Trying to play the hero again?

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.080
No. I actually had a coupon...

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:31.880
What coupon?

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.540
Pizza time! Thanks for your order!

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.460
Wha...?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.040
I thought this would be a good time
to celebrate my joining the team, you know?

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.290
It was a surprise!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.960
A surprise party!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.420
What do we do with all this...?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.420
I figured we might have trouble finishing it
off without those two around.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.750
Not a fan of cheese?

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:55.330
You never cease to leave me astounded.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.130
Thanks, man!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.460
That wasn't a compliment.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.290
Yummy!

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:07.040
So this is the famous "pizza" I've heard so much about!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.000
I've always wanted to try having some!

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.580
Wha?! You've never had pizza before?!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.380
Well, I was never allowed to partake in any back home.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.960
Would you mind telling me how you ordered it?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.750
Uh, I placed an order on my phone like normal...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.040
Fascinating! So this the taste of society.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.000
The affluent live in another world, huh?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.290
Lady Oka...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.670
Let's all partake in this feast!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.710
Hell yeah! What a jump!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.880
Now you're everyone's big hero. Congrats!

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.210
Don't give me that crap!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:00.500
Huh?

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.960
Those weren't my skills!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.790
I wasn't the one who jumped!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.670
Why should that matter?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.670
We're about to become one anyways!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.130
Stop it! I'm the only me that I need!

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.580
Not you!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.500
You stayed true to yourself.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.040
I'm impressed.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.920
Naruse?

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:35.920
Fancy running into you here.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.880
You're, uh... Tobe?

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:40.830
Just call me Yoko.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.210
You quit?!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.960
Does that mean you're not coming
to Sunday's track meet?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.420
Yeah.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:49.750
Why?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.420
Stuff happened.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.380
That's not an answer.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.500
Look, I've got a lot on my plate right now.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.130
Trying to quit undefeated?

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.920
Don't be ridiculous. You were declared the winner.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.250
But you surpassed me.
You jumped over the bar I couldn't.

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.630
That's not true. I cheated to make that happen.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.710
That's bullshit!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.000
You better come and watch me!
I'm going to jump higher than you did!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.960
Don't chicken out!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:37.040
<b>KAEDE</b>

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:37.040
<b>I'm done for today.</b>

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:37.040
<b>Kaede...</b>

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.290
<b>You have a new message</b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:47.000
<b>Hi, Haruko!</b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:47.000
<b>Please come watch</b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:47.000
<b>our meet on Sunday!</b>

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.330
Is that you Haruko?

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:49.920
Miwa...

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.670
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.460
I just wanted to talk with Kaede alone.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.210
No need to apologize! So, how'd it go?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.040
That sucks...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.500
Um... I really hope you don't have
any hard feelings toward Kaede.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.000
Far from it actually!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.130
Huh?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:13.630
She's great! We wouldn't have been able
to save that guy from falling without her!

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.420
I totally respect her!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.750
She's a hero in my book!

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.420
I bet she'll get mad if I tell her that, though.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:27.500
Did something happen to Kaede?

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.670
I'm not sure.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.460
I used to be able to tell exactly what she was thinking.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.630
We were really close back then.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.750
I was the manager of the track
and field team that she was on.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.880
Kaede...?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.790
Oh Kaede! There you are!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.790
Where did you disappear to?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.290
Haruko. I'm quitting the team.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.420
What?

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:02.830
But why?

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.130
What happened?!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:10.170
I just don't deserve the privilege of jumping anymore.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:16.000
Kaede used the power of the Oni
to make her jump that day.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.330
And she nearly let them consume her.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.880
So she got possessed? Like I did?

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.710
A half-possessed pushover
like you doesn't really compare.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.710
Kaede was strong enough to
overcome the Oni on her own.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.170
That stings...

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.460
It's actually true for everyone in our group.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:35.880
Wait, even you?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.540
I wanted to help Kaede somehow, so I joined the fight.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.920
But now, Kaede and I...

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.540
We're just growing further apart!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.460
Uh, well....

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.040
Hey! Have you ever played single-ball dodgeball?

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:01.210
It can be hella scary when you're up
against a bunch of muscleheads!

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:05.670
Uh, I'm sorry, I actually haven't
played dodgeball in a long time...

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.960
Well, let me tell you, my buddy Kippei
is crazy good at dodging.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.790
Nobody has managed to send him to
the outfield since way back in second grade!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.500
Anyway, the point I'm trying to make is...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.210
Kaede got hit and now she's in the outfield.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.580
She's what...?

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:25.580
Kaede was trying her best to keep you safe from
the outfield, but then you got hit and now you're both out.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.630
So she's totally panicked about it!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.460
Despite what she says,
I know Kaede is totally the hero type.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:36.080
I'm not really following you,
but I agree that Kaede is a hero.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.380
Exactly!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:41.210
A real hero always fights on behalf of others.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.880
On behalf... of others...

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.790
Shikizakura.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.790
Shikizakura.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:00.040
<b>Toyota Bridge</b>

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.290
You better come and watch me!
I'm going to jump higher than you did!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.210
Don't chicken out!

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.460
Yoko?

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.790
You're such a badass for not running away, Yoko.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.630
You know how to tough it out and
I think that deserves a reward.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:31.540
Don't worry. This power belongs entirely to you.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.330
Look out!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.290
Oh my god!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:13:59.380
I'm light as a feather!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.500
I can jump higher than anyone now!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.500
Hell, I could even fly if I wanted!

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.290
She's going through what I did!

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:11.170
Snap out of it, Yoko!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.210
Watch this, Kaede.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.420
I'm about to break every record in the books.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:19.250
You can't let the Oni sweet talk you!
Using their power isn't worth it!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.880
Now I get it. This is the power you used to jump, huh?

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.920
That's right. But it was a terrible mistake!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.580
I betrayed them all... everyone who believed in me!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.880
That's what's holding you back? How silly.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.670
Just do it for yourself and screw what other people think.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.250
This is my power now! I'm going
to use it to jump for my own glory!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.540
And nobody's gonna get in my way!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:55.080
Just like I told you! This place is swarming with Oni!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.460
Both Kaede and Haruko should be up ahead!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.290
Guess we're a little late!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.710
All right, what's the plan, twerp?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.750
Charge right up the middle, of course!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.040
Now you're talking my language!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.040
Why won't you listen to me?!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:11.380
You think you don't deserve to jump
because you betrayed everyone?

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.750
Quitting is the real betrayal!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.670
You let me down as a rival!

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.670
And your teammates, too!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.960
How long are you gonna stab us in the back?!

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.000
I just...

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.210
You're wrong!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.630
Kaede hasn't stabbed anyone in the back!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.630
Haruko!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.420
Because none of us ever thought that she betrayed us!

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:38.210
Kaede did everything she could
on our behalf! We know that!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.290
Who the hell said you could butt in!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.250
Haruko!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.290
Haruko!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:52.460
Kaede!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.080
Haruko!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.210
Kaede!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.250
Haruko!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.210
I'll save you! No matter what!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:44.670
You okay?

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.750
Kaede, are you flying?!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.040
Yeah... I did it...

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.630
I can fly!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:00.880
I'm sorry.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.540
I made you do so much alone. I relied on you too often.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.210
Huh?

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.080
I could tell that you were afraid, all this time.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.460
You were bearing the burdens by yourself
and I didn't know how to help.

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.880
I was hoping to keep it all a secret from you...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.880
I didn't want to bring it up, either.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:20.540
But I came to a decision!

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.790
To stop holding back and come
at you straight like a dodgeball!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.000
The truth is... I can't be like Ryo and Kakeru.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.830
That doesn't matter. You still have what it takes.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.420
You're amazing, Kaede!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:41.080
You have such a kind heart,
and it drives you to help other people!

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.580
That's what I like about you the most!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.250
Haruko...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.710
I'll stay by your side! So let's fight together!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.710
Time to cut loose!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.040
Here comes the hero!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.130
Kaede...

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.380
Save the vessel!

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.380
Roger that!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.290
Let Yoko go!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.630
Just try and surpass me now, Kaede Naruse!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.080
This is my newfound power!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.080
You're making a mistake!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.670
Haruko, I need some help.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:08.670
I've got you covered!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.630
Thank you, Haruko!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.330
Leave here and return from whence you came.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:44.130
Naruse? I was out to get you...

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.080
So then, why did you save me?

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:49.080
It's what friends do.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.790
You're always... such a sap.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.580
Some people say that's my best feature, you know.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.790
<b>Chukyo High School 53rd Track Meet</b>

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:12.290
I hope that this moment never ends

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:16.290
I hope that it continues for decades to come

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:22.710
Becoming unable to even wear pretty outfits

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:27.210
In a world where only I have passed on

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:31.500
The cider I disliked that day

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.710
The cry of the missing cicadas

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.040
Drowning into fate

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.130
Not knowing how to struggle

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:43.960
It's almost as if I'm invisible to everyone

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.790
I don't even feel the urge to resist

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.630
After you helped pulled me along

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:57.420
I saw the beautiful colors of the world

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.960
In the season of blooming cherry blossoms

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:04.170
Captivated by that innocent smile

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:08.210
There is nothing that can't be changed

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:12.290
And that's true of any sad future too, right?

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.580
Haruko told me what happened.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.170
Thanks, dude.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.210
Huh? For what?

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:46.130
Here! My treat!

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.420
You're hard to understand.

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:58.250
Now that's sweet!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.670
What's the problem?

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.250
Well, I'm not a big fan of fizzy drinks...

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:08.960
Damn it! What a waste...

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:16.460
Th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-that was....

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.290
an indirect kiss?!

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:24.830
That cheeky little punk...

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:28.040
What's he doing hanging around Kaede?

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.880
It was totally nuts!

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:37.880
Hey Kippei! Let's hit up Manga Bliss!

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:39.040
What? Manga kiss?!

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.500
Bliss! It's a cafe, dude!

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.080
Why are you so fixated on kisses lately?

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:43.580
Enough! I'm getting burnt out!

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:44.540
Did you say make out?!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:45.500
Ugh!

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:50.750
<b>Family</b>

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:46.830
Next episode: "Family"

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:48.130
Hey brother!

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:50.000
There ain't no secrets between us!
